{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもお世話になっている大好きな皆さんへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表が行われた後、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くこの喜びをファンの皆様に伝えたかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっと、、ただいま^ ^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもの場所で呼ばれなくて、その後もなかなか呼ばれなくて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの人は一度は絶対「かずみん落ちた！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思ったよね＞_＜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいことに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2年ぶりに福神に復帰させていただきました..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2015/05/11/5425355/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に、ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ、感謝の気持ちでいっぱいとはこういうことなんだなぁと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選ばれた後、しばらくはメンバー、スタッフさんがもちろん近くにいて、カメラが回ってないところで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ウェーイ!｣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「よろしく！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「おめでとう！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と色んな方が小声で言ってくれてですね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第一の感想としては、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...めっちゃ嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの人、喜んでくれるだろうなぁって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「かずみんのこと、ずっと応援するよ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆さんからのその言葉が今の私を大きくしてくださったから^ ^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな大切な大好きな皆様に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってる姿、笑ってる姿を沢山見せたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして少しは恩返しできたらいいな？と強く思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、自分の中でやっぱりバラエティーに出るごとになんか不安がありまして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂の高山？知らないよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって歌番組とかいなくない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂での活動のとき映ってなくない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでバラエティー出てんの？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と視聴者の方からはこう思われてるだろうなぁって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから何か残さなきゃというプレッシャーは倍ありました。汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも頑張ることに変わりはないです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しくじり先生のスタッフさんやレギュラー陣の皆さんにはいつもお世話になっていて、頑張ってと応援していただいてたので、早くお礼を言いたいなぁと思ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日の収録でお伝えしたら、よかったね〜〜！しくじり効果か！？と皆さんが言ってくださって、本当に嬉しかったです(*´v`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてやっぱり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分に自信が持てない私は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何で私なんだろうとかも思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも選抜発表から色々考えて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分なりの答えを見つけました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、乃木坂46は一人一人がどんどん勢いを増しています！そんな中今回は私に、高山にチャンスの順番を与えてくださったのだと思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"裏を返せば、ここで高山は頑張らないともうチャンスはしばらく回ってこないぞといわれているように感じました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も、高山ファンの皆さんも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の12thに試されている気がします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次が本当に大大大チャンス。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はそう思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝負のつもりで、頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一体何を頑張るのか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は頑張らなきゃいけないことは夏にかけて山ほどあるのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ内容は言えないけどお楽しみに^ ^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、見守っていてくださいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーといると、はしゃいでしまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまに無口になるけど...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも落ち着きのない高山でごめんね＞_＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのみんなのことが大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切な仲間です。なんか直接は恥ずかしくて言えないけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかくチャンスを貰ってるくせに頑張ってなかったらみんなに嫌われると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなんなったら、絶対辛い（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから全精力で頑張るよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど自分が自分がになるのもあんまり好きくないので(汗)乃木坂46のためにより良い、私なりの役割を果たしたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもお世話になっているファンの皆さんにお願いがあります。今までは申し訳ないとか思いながらなかなか言えませんでしたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12枚目シングル、私と一緒に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうか、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップギアで挑んでください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2015/05/11/5425355/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい思い出作るよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山一実"}],"source":"archive"}